 function are functions"},{"adds":["readings"],"id":"walk.pc-load-is-pool","reads":["rom"],"recovers":"pool words decoded as instructions, and the pointers a pool holds (seed.pool-pointer reads them)","restsOn":"agbcc and the assembler place the constants a function loads with `ldr rd, [pc, #imm]` in literal pools","summary":"a pc-relative load names a literal-pool word, recorded with its value; the path goes on"}]}
